  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Again,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org